), the band encompasses a wealth of experience, knowledge and love of the hot club/ gypsy jazz style. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Gala Lunchtime Concert Series (Oct 2026)","instanceDates":"23 October-23 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"820202ABSVCTDDMMGBJJBNGLPTQTJVPBS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T13:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T12:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T12:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"720501","attribute_Certificate":"N/A","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"N/A","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"N/A","attribute_EventType":"Theatre","attribute_Genre":"Music","attribute_ScreenNumber":"1","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_Sitename":"N/A","attribute_Genre1":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Genre3":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Cast":"","attribute_PaymentGateway":"","attribute_PaymentID":""},{"description":"4.30pm-6pm","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":0,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Gala Youth Theatre Autumn Term 12-18 Years 2026","instanceDates":"23 September-2 December","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"859003ADCTTQNHQKQJMJNRJKVRLBDSCRG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-09-23T16:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-09-23T15:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-02T16:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-02T16:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"720501","attribute_Certificate":"N/A","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"N/A","attribute_EDISiteNumber":"N/A","attribute_EventType":"Theatre","attribute_Genre":"Theatre","attribute_ScreenNumber":"1","attribute_SendToDCM":"No","attribute_Sitename":"Gala","attribute_Genre1":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Genre3":"","attribute_Director":"","attribute_Cast":"","attribute_PaymentGateway":"","attribute_PaymentID":""},{"description":"10am-11am","htmlDescription":"<div i